#: ../doc/preferences.rst:389
msgid ""
"On Linux, the unsaved assets folder defaults to ``~/Videos/.openshot-tmp`` "
"when ``~/Videos`` exists and the hidden child folder is writable. Otherwise,"
" OpenShot uses ``~/.openshot_qt``, which is also the default on other "
"platforms. You can choose a different folder in Preferences. Saving a "
"project relocates its assets into the project's ``<project>_assets`` folder;"
" subsequent titles and animations use that folder. These assets can include "
"media needed by an unsaved project or crash recovery, so do not delete the "
"folder as ordinary disposable cache data."
msgstr ""
"Di Linux, folder aset yang belum disimpan secara default adalah "
"``~/Videos/.openshot-tmp`` ketika ``~/Videos`` ada dan folder anak "
"tersembunyi dapat ditulis. Jika tidak, OpenShot menggunakan "
"``~/.openshot_qt``, yang juga merupakan default di platform lain. Anda dapat"
" memilih folder berbeda di Preferensi. Menyimpan proyek memindahkan asetnya "
"ke folder ``<project>_assets`` proyek; judul dan animasi berikutnya "
"menggunakan folder tersebut. Aset ini dapat mencakup media yang dibutuhkan "
"oleh proyek yang belum disimpan atau pemulihan setelah crash, jadi jangan "
"hapus folder ini sebagai data cache yang bisa dibuang biasa."

